---
// Pricing section component - directs visitors to request a quote by phone or email
---

<section
  id="pricing"
  class="py-20 bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-50 to-gray-100 dark:from-gray-800 dark:to-gray-900 transition-colors duration-200"
>
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
    <div class="text-center mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4">Pricing</h2>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Every home and business is different, so we quote each job individually. For a quote, please call or email us
        &mdash; it's free and there's no obligation.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-xl p-8 md:p-10 shadow-lg dark:border dark:border-gray-700">
        <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          <a
            href="tel:+7703807040"
            class="flex items-center justify-center gap-3 bg-blue-600 text-white px-6 py-4 rounded-lg text-lg font-semibold hover:bg-blue-700 transition"
          >
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                stroke-width="2"
                d="M3 5a2 2 0 012-2h3.28a1 1 0 01.948.684l1.498 4.493a1 1 0 01-.502 1.21l-2.257 1.13a11.042 11.042 0 005.516 5.516l1.13-2.257a1 1 0 011.21-.502l4.493 1.498a1 1 0 01.684.949V19a2 2 0 01-2 2h-1C9.716 21 3 14.284 3 6V5z"
              ></path>
            </svg>
            (770) 380-7040
          </a>

          <a
            href="mailto:TheTidyGalCleanning@gmail.com"
            class="flex items-center justify-center gap-3 bg-white dark:bg-gray-700 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 px-6 py-4 rounded-lg text-lg font-semibold hover:bg-gray-50 dark:hover:bg-gray-600 transition border-2 border-blue-600 dark:border-blue-400"
          >
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                stroke-width="2"
                d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"
              ></path>
            </svg>
            Email Us
          </a>
        </div>

        <p class="mt-8 text-center text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">
          Tell us your property size, the type of cleaning you need, and how often you'd like service, and we'll get
          back to you with a quote.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-6 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">
      <p>
        <em
          >Initial cleanings and non-regular cleanings may be more expensive depending on the condition of the property.</em
        >
      </p>
      <p>
        <em
          >For the safety of our staff, homes requiring the removal of animal or human waste, extensive mold
          remediation, or biohazard cleanup must be remediated prior to our service.</em
        >
      </p>
      <a
        href="#contact"
        class="inline-block text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 font-semibold hover:text-blue-700 dark:hover:text-blue-300 transition"
      >
        Or send us a message →
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
